WEBVTT

01:12.740 --> 01:13.990
Ouch!

01:32.440 --> 01:33.860
Be safe!

01:33.860 --> 01:35.400
Good morning!

01:38.570 --> 01:44.050
<i>The rapid train will be arriving 
shortly at platform one.</i>

01:45.560 --> 01:48.530
<i>Please stand behind the yellow line.</i>

01:50.480 --> 01:51.380
Excuse me!

01:52.600 --> 01:57.360
<i>Thank you for riding with us. 
Please wait for the next train.</i>

02:05.290 --> 02:10.720
<i>Thank you very much 
for using our station today.</i>

02:35.180 --> 02:36.550
There are two meetings today.

02:36.550 --> 02:38.390
The materials have all been prepared.

02:38.770 --> 02:43.420
There are also four issues that need to be 
addressed before I leave for my business trip.

02:52.310 --> 02:53.980
Excuse me! This is my stop!

03:48.500 --> 03:53.000
<b>The Masterful Cat
Is Depressed Again Today</b>

04:05.260 --> 04:07.260
<b>Cages</b>

04:05.260 --> 04:07.260
<b>Healing</b>

04:05.260 --> 04:07.260
<b>Clothes</b>

04:05.260 --> 04:07.260
<b>Cosplay</b>

04:05.260 --> 04:07.260
<b>Illustrations</b>

04:05.260 --> 04:07.260
<b>Screensavers</b>

04:05.260 --> 04:07.260
<b>Backgrounds</b>

04:05.260 --> 04:07.260
<b>Dogs</b>

04:17.070 --> 04:19.380
Saku-senpai!

04:19.860 --> 04:22.190
You're not going to eat any lunch?

04:22.190 --> 04:25.860
Y-Y-Yuri-chan! You scared me!

04:27.400 --> 04:28.480
You're hiding something.

04:28.950 --> 04:29.730
Huh?!

04:29.730 --> 04:34.940
Senpai, you shouldn't access 
matchmaking sites on a work computer.

04:34.940 --> 04:36.510
I'm not!

04:37.750 --> 04:40.500
<b>Healing
 Clothes
 Cosplay
 Illustrations
 Screensavers
 Backgrounds
 Dog
 Kotatsu
 Anthropomorphism</b>

04:37.750 --> 04:40.510
The world's largest cat?

04:41.240 --> 04:44.310
Why're you looking up something like that?

04:44.310 --> 04:45.510
Whoa! So big!

04:46.540 --> 04:48.800
These are Maine Coon cats.

04:48.800 --> 04:50.990
Actually, I've been taking care of a cat myself.

04:50.990 --> 04:55.420
I was just wondering how 
big they normally get.

04:56.390 --> 04:58.990
Senpai, that's pretty careless of you.

04:58.990 --> 05:00.900
Huh? Wh-What do you mean?!

05:01.360 --> 05:03.180
They say if you get 
a pet while living alone,

05:03.180 --> 05:05.710
you ruin your chances at marriage!

05:05.710 --> 05:08.560
Huh? Why do you keep bringing 
marriage into the conversation?!

05:08.560 --> 05:09.660
Shibasaki-san.

05:10.690 --> 05:14.010
They moved up the afternoon 
meeting by thirty minutes.

05:14.010 --> 05:15.360
Huh?!

05:15.360 --> 05:16.330
Sorry!

05:17.860 --> 05:19.730
I should eat my lunch.

05:20.760 --> 05:22.790
Oh, Senpai! Your cat!

05:22.790 --> 05:23.670
Yes?!

05:24.030 --> 05:26.700
Let me know if taking care 
of your cat is too much for you.

05:27.130 --> 05:30.450
I bet my parents will 
take it in if I ask them.

05:30.450 --> 05:33.880
Oh. Thanks a lot.

05:37.120 --> 05:39.370
Now, time for lunch...

05:57.900 --> 06:00.330
<i>If taking care of my cat 
is too much for me, huh?</i>

06:05.080 --> 06:07.210
<i>I guess it could be...</i>

06:11.980 --> 06:13.760
I'm home!

06:13.760 --> 06:16.270
Yukichi? Hey, Yukichi!

06:25.050 --> 06:31.880
<i>Well, maybe if my cat was a normal cat.</i>

06:34.610 --> 06:35.950
Jeez!

06:36.320 --> 06:38.520
You're cleaning in the dark again!

06:38.520 --> 06:41.080
I keep telling you to do it 
with the lights on!

06:42.540 --> 06:44.590
Are you mad about something?

06:46.890 --> 06:48.480
I'm home too late?

06:48.480 --> 06:50.220
Isn't this the normal time I get home?

06:50.630 --> 06:56.970
<b>{}P{*\3c&H3D5142&}r{*\3c&H425649&}e{*\3c&H465B50&}m{*\3c&H4B6056&}i{*\3c&H4F655D&}u{*\3c&H536A64&}m {*\3c&H5C7372&}F{*\3c&H607879&}r{*\3c&H657D7F&}i{*\3c&H698286&}d{*\3c&H6E878D&}ay</b>

06:52.030 --> 06:53.960
Premium Friday?

06:53.960 --> 06:56.180
That's an impossible fantasy, Yukichi.

06:59.690 --> 07:01.170
Why were you interested in—

07:03.110 --> 07:05.730
<b>Completely Cold Feast</b>

07:06.490 --> 07:07.330
Sorry!

07:07.330 --> 07:08.720
I'm so sorry, Yukichi!

07:08.300 --> 07:10.130
<i>I was waiting for you all evening.</i>

07:08.720 --> 07:10.990
I'll eat it now!

07:15.880 --> 07:18.440
Now, this is happiness!

07:18.880 --> 07:21.160
I feel so sleepy now.

07:21.700 --> 07:23.470
Sleepy...

07:49.080 --> 07:50.070
It's hot!

07:50.440 --> 07:53.400
Hot! Hot! Hot! Hot!

07:53.400 --> 07:54.950
You cruel cat!

08:16.080 --> 08:18.220
I feel completely, totally revived!

08:18.220 --> 08:21.230
Oh! Lunch was delicious as usual, Yukichi!

08:22.350 --> 08:24.090
Thanks for making lunch every day!

08:25.480 --> 08:30.030
Now that I've washed up, 
I totally want a beer!

08:32.980 --> 08:35.410
Are these fried chicken and cheese strips?!

08:35.410 --> 08:37.740
Yukichi, can I eat these?!

08:39.130 --> 08:41.220
I can't?

08:41.220 --> 08:43.620
They're for tomorrow's lunch?

08:44.210 --> 08:47.460
I see. I guess it can't be helped.

08:47.460 --> 08:51.950
They look so good, but I'll
 have to wait until tomorrow.

08:51.950 --> 08:54.840
I see. They're for lunch...

08:56.660 --> 08:58.670
Huh? You'll make me something else?

08:58.670 --> 09:00.620
I'll go dry my hair really quick!

09:02.780 --> 09:06.850
Wow! The delicious smell of cheese!

09:07.220 --> 09:08.990
They look so freaking good!

09:08.990 --> 09:10.530
Thanks, Yukichi!

09:10.530 --> 09:12.220
Thank you for the meal!

09:15.660 --> 09:17.680
There's edamame in them, too.

09:17.680 --> 09:19.960
What a forbidden flavor!

09:22.440 --> 09:27.050
You've completely won me over 
via my stomach already,

09:29.290 --> 09:31.130
People say that if you get 
a pet while living alone,

09:31.130 --> 09:33.350
you ruin your chances at marriage!

09:33.350 --> 09:34.260
Huh?

09:38.510 --> 09:40.210
<i>Who the heck cares?!</i>

09:43.460 --> 09:45.680
Yukichi! Another beer!

09:52.070 --> 09:55.990
I still wanna drink!

10:33.250 --> 10:34.480
<i>Perfect.</i>

10:40.170 --> 10:41.770
<i>Zero Seven Five Five!</i>

10:41.770 --> 10:43.530
<i>What's today's good morning song?</i>

10:51.030 --> 10:53.040
Oh, the aroma of fried chicken...

10:54.650 --> 10:57.050
Can't breathe!

11:00.280 --> 11:02.240
I don't wanna go to work!

11:02.240 --> 11:04.550
I don't wanna work!

11:04.550 --> 11:07.690
I have a meeting with the general 
manager first thing in the morning,

11:07.690 --> 11:09.970
but I don't have all the documents ready!

11:09.970 --> 11:13.440
I mean, why do we have to have so 
many meetings every day anyways?

11:13.440 --> 11:15.540
I'll definitely have to work overtime again.

11:15.540 --> 11:19.900
Can't we just give all these progress 
reports through our smartphones?!

11:19.900 --> 11:23.540
What's the point of making 
printouts at every single step?

11:23.540 --> 11:25.770
And the trains are always packed!

11:25.770 --> 11:27.610
It hurts!

11:27.610 --> 11:29.470
The trains are full of drunks, too!

11:29.470 --> 11:32.710
I really wanna quit!

11:33.580 --> 11:34.520
Yukichi!

11:34.520 --> 11:36.210
You're my only ally...

11:38.150 --> 11:38.940
Huh?

11:40.840 --> 11:42.970
<i>Lock up properly.</i>

12:01.110 --> 12:03.040
Mommy, look!

12:04.390 --> 12:05.700
Oh, how rare!

12:05.700 --> 12:06.990
A bear rug!

12:06.990 --> 12:08.620
Bear!

12:08.620 --> 12:11.310
<i>Thanks for watching </i>It's Afternoon<i>!</i>

12:11.310 --> 12:14.290
<i>We'll start with the ever-popular 
Empress of Recipes!</i>

12:14.290 --> 12:18.460
<i>Today, I'd like to show you a recipe I recommend
 for dealing with exhaustion and stress!</i>

12:18.460 --> 12:21.670
<i>It's a stamina curry sauté of sliced 
beef and summer vegetables!</i>

12:21.670 --> 12:23.960
<i>Everyone, please be ready to jot it down!</i>

12:23.960 --> 12:27.090
<i>Now, let me show you the ingredients 
and how to make it!</i>

12:27.090 --> 12:30.880
<i>First, peel the tomatoes by parboiling them. 
Then cut them into wedges.</i>

12:30.880 --> 12:34.930
<i>Cut the bell pepper vertically into strips.</i>

12:34.930 --> 12:38.370
<i>Then, heat olive oil in a frying pan over low heat and add the garlic.</i>

12:38.370 --> 12:42.870
<i>Spice lovers can also add takanotsume peppers.</i>

12:42.870 --> 12:45.840
<i>Once the garlic becomes aromatic, 
add the beef and bell peppers.</i>

12:45.840 --> 12:47.530
<i>Season with salt and pepper.</i>

12:47.530 --> 12:51.410
<i>After the meat browns, 
add one teaspoon of wine vinegar.</i>

12:51.410 --> 12:54.950
<i>Boil out the alcohol and add 
the tomatoes to sauté them quickly.</i>

12:54.950 --> 12:56.850
<i>Add one tablespoon of curry powder,</i>

12:56.850 --> 12:59.360
<i>and finish it off with 
a sprinkle of minced parsley.</i>

12:59.360 --> 13:01.560
<i>Please give this recipe a try!</i>

13:02.320 --> 13:03.570
<i>Memorized!</i>

13:15.270 --> 13:17.150
<i>I dislike water.</i>

13:27.710 --> 13:29.870
<i>Perfect. Part II.</i>

13:32.550 --> 13:34.720
<i>No one is available to answer your call.</i>

13:34.720 --> 13:38.000
<i>Please leave a message after the beep.</i>

13:38.850 --> 13:41.590
<i>Ah, hello? Can you hear me, Yukichi?</i>

13:42.010 --> 13:44.000
<i>We hit some trouble at work.</i>

13:44.000 --> 13:46.280
<i>I don't need dinner since 
I probably have to stay the night.</i>

13:46.280 --> 13:47.200
<i>Sorry!</i>

13:49.260 --> 13:53.270
Meanwhile,
 at the company...

13:55.140 --> 13:56.410
Hey! Someone!

13:56.410 --> 13:59.370
Please go to the document room and find me 
the previous documents for Company A!

13:59.370 --> 14:02.150
Convert it to digital data 
and send it to the chief!

14:02.150 --> 14:05.030
We're out of paper at a time like this?! 
Where's the paper again?!

14:05.730 --> 14:08.110
Will we finish all of this 
by tomorrow morning?!

14:11.160 --> 14:12.170
<i>A call?</i>

14:12.170 --> 14:13.810
<i>From home?!</i>

14:13.810 --> 14:16.210
<i>Yukichi? Did he call me back?</i>

14:17.760 --> 14:19.570
H-Hello?

14:21.600 --> 14:22.840
<i>He clicked his tongue at me?</i>

14:25.170 --> 14:28.560
Hey, Fukuzawa is starting 
to move at an inhuman speed!

14:28.560 --> 14:29.660
She's evolving!

14:29.660 --> 14:31.600
Fukuzawa is evolving!

14:31.600 --> 14:35.060
<i>She managed to get back
 on the third to last train.</i>

14:35.930 --> 14:40.480
Yukichi. You smell like the sun...

14:42.440 --> 14:49.490
<i>The neko chigura, also known as the neko tsugura, 
is a traditional hand-crafted cat bed.</i>

14:49.900 --> 14:54.510
My family's previous cat 
used to use it. Please take it.

14:55.420 --> 14:57.750
Yuri-chan gave this to me, but...

15:05.480 --> 15:07.740
<i>A-A helmet?!</i>

15:08.940 --> 15:13.300
I-It was unavoidable. Yuri-chan has
 never seen you, Yukichi.

15:14.560 --> 15:16.040
Hey, Yukichi?

15:21.540 --> 15:23.440
That's impossible!

15:30.030 --> 15:31.760
Looks like he likes it.

15:33.620 --> 15:38.120
The Next Day

15:33.970 --> 15:36.780
Yay! You made me lunch today, too?

15:36.780 --> 15:37.990
Thanks!

15:37.990 --> 15:40.870
Hm? What's this paper bag for?

15:41.550 --> 15:43.140
Huh? No way.

15:43.140 --> 15:45.130
Is this to thank Yuri-chan for the chigura?

15:45.130 --> 15:46.960
Wow. Madeleines!

15:47.530 --> 15:49.050
Oh, you're too much!

15:49.050 --> 15:52.180
You're such a thoughtful cat, Yukichi!

15:52.180 --> 15:55.800
They smell so good! 
I'm sure they're delicious!

15:56.390 --> 15:58.340
Huh? What about my share?

15:57.680 --> 15:58.520
<b>Meow</b>

15:58.340 --> 15:59.470
So stingy!

15:59.470 --> 16:00.670
Huh?

16:00.670 --> 16:02.730
You're giving these to me?

16:03.150 --> 16:05.000
I feel bad getting something in exchange.

16:05.000 --> 16:06.250
Y-Yeah...

16:06.250 --> 16:09.350
Oh, are these handmade?

16:09.350 --> 16:11.070
Th-That's right.

16:11.070 --> 16:12.580
That's amazing!

16:12.580 --> 16:14.930
Oh, do you like homemade desserts?

16:14.930 --> 16:16.370
I'm so happy!

16:16.370 --> 16:20.230
Wow! Fukuzawa-san can even bake sweets?

16:20.230 --> 16:21.700
Such strong home-making skills!

16:21.700 --> 16:23.370
Th-That's not true!

16:23.370 --> 16:25.410
They're delicious!

16:25.410 --> 16:27.220
Fukuzawa, you always bring your lunch, too.

16:27.220 --> 16:28.710
You'll make a great wife.

16:28.710 --> 16:30.300
Uh, no! That's...

16:28.710 --> 16:33.170
Goodness, sir! You should 
make your own lunches yourself!

16:33.260 --> 16:34.380
<b>Make your own lunches yourself~ (LOL)</b>

16:35.310 --> 16:38.740
<i>I-It's hard to tell them I didn't do it...</i>

16:35.510 --> 16:36.630
That's true.

16:36.630 --> 16:38.740
That's the least you can do!

16:38.740 --> 16:40.320
Maybe I should try making 
my own lunches, too.

16:40.320 --> 16:42.890
No! I-I-I really can't cook at all!

16:42.890 --> 16:47.800
What are you talking about? 
You're plenty good at it!

16:43.980 --> 16:47.800
If you consider yourself a bad cook, 
the rest of us are completely worthless.

16:47.800 --> 16:49.020
No, no, no, no...

16:47.800 --> 16:49.020
So true! So true!

16:49.020 --> 16:51.530
I mean, it was my cat that...

16:52.380 --> 16:54.870
<i>"It was my cat that baked that!"</i>

16:54.870 --> 16:57.070
<i>Huh? What are you saying?</i>

16:57.070 --> 17:00.040
<i>Huh? Is Fukuzawa-san an oddball type?</i>

17:02.220 --> 17:04.660
I-I baked them!

17:04.660 --> 17:07.020
Huh? Did you spike them with something?

17:07.020 --> 17:08.750
I looked up the recipe online...

17:08.750 --> 17:09.790
Huh?!

17:10.350 --> 17:12.910
<i>I've become such a blatant liar!</i>

17:12.910 --> 17:14.760
<i>I'm sorry, Yukichi!</i>

17:15.340 --> 17:18.600
<i>I mean, something like that's 
normally impossible.</i>

17:18.600 --> 17:21.520
<i>A cat shouldn't be able to do 
all the housework for me.</i>

17:21.520 --> 17:23.680
<i>Why didn't I think of that until now?</i>

17:24.560 --> 17:25.510
Okay!

17:25.510 --> 17:29.080
<i>I'll just keep quiet about Yukichi.</i>

17:29.080 --> 17:31.690
Is your cat doing well?

17:32.820 --> 17:36.000
These are the documents 
you asked for earlier.

17:36.000 --> 17:38.870
Also, about the estimate 
requested by Company C...

17:47.990 --> 17:50.540
Ch-Chief, what did you just...

17:50.960 --> 17:53.650
I'm talking about the estimate 
requested by Company C.

17:54.050 --> 17:55.830
It's still before the deadline, 
but the other party...

17:55.830 --> 17:57.630
B-B-Before that!

17:58.350 --> 17:59.640
Your cat?

17:59.640 --> 18:00.640
Yes!

18:00.640 --> 18:02.720
It's true that I have a cat...

18:03.140 --> 18:06.610
Well, you mentioned your 
cat earlier, so I thought...

18:07.690 --> 18:08.580
Thanks.

18:08.580 --> 18:11.730
Huh? How did you know about my cat, Chief?

18:13.060 --> 18:15.180
I met him before.

18:17.200 --> 18:18.740
Sorry, I have a call.

18:20.370 --> 18:21.990
Hello. This is Orizuka.

18:22.990 --> 18:25.750
<i>He met him before?!</i>

18:34.960 --> 18:39.670
<i>He left for another business trip 
before I could talk to him about it.</i>

18:39.130 --> 18:41.800
<b>He left immediately after having
a meeting outside of the company.</b>

18:39.670 --> 18:40.420
See you.

18:40.420 --> 18:43.470
<i>The soonest he'll be back is next week.</i>

18:44.260 --> 18:46.880
<i>I'm so worried! It's going to keep me up!</i>

18:48.820 --> 18:53.450
<i>I won't get any rest over 
the weekend like this...</i>

18:56.190 --> 18:58.080
I'm home, Yukichi.

19:00.780 --> 19:02.320
Worry
Worry

19:02.530 --> 19:02.910
<b>Pop</b>

19:03.410 --> 19:07.950
Oh my gosh, it smells so good!

19:09.730 --> 19:13.030
What's for dinner tonight?! 
I want to drink some beer!

19:13.490 --> 19:15.670
<i>I slept super well.</i>

19:16.740 --> 19:18.890
<i>These are blue light glasses.</i>

19:43.590 --> 19:44.490
Oh?

19:45.320 --> 19:47.220
Oh, my. Yukichi-chan.

19:47.220 --> 19:49.870
Have you grown a little bigger?

19:50.880 --> 19:53.580
You're working so hard 
so early in the morning.

19:54.800 --> 19:56.750
Always so polite.

19:58.240 --> 20:02.190
Thank you for helping me carry mine, too.

20:11.140 --> 20:15.350
The trash doesn't get scavenged 
with you around, Yukichi-chan.

20:23.320 --> 20:28.210
How many years has it been since Saku-chan 
brought you home, Yukichi-chan?

20:30.220 --> 20:34.500
When she brought such a weak kitten 
home during such a big snowstorm,

20:34.500 --> 20:38.380
I was worried you wouldn't make it.

20:41.880 --> 20:43.490
Oh, my...

20:47.270 --> 20:48.390
Are you all right?

20:49.640 --> 20:52.780
I picked him up from nearby!

21:04.710 --> 21:08.320
I never thought you'd grow so big.

21:09.850 --> 21:11.450
So impressive! So impressive!

21:12.240 --> 21:14.460
Oh, that's right. Take this with you.

21:16.680 --> 21:19.950
I got too much as a gift again.

21:17.690 --> 21:18.940
<i>I love dried seaweed!</i>

21:28.170 --> 21:30.090
Good morning...

21:33.280 --> 21:36.390
Something smells super good.

21:39.210 --> 21:40.860
Seaweed chicken meatballs!

21:40.860 --> 21:43.400
Yay! I wanna eat them!

21:43.400 --> 21:47.110
Seaweed
 Chicken Meatball
 Rice Bowl

21:44.110 --> 21:45.800
Thanks for the meal!

21:47.660 --> 21:50.450
<b>Finished</b>

21:47.660 --> 21:50.450
<b>Finished</b>

21:48.820 --> 21:50.450
So good!

21:50.450 --> 21:53.430
Your seaweed chicken meatballs 
are the best, Yukichi!

21:54.070 --> 21:56.110
Another serving!

21:58.250 --> 21:59.790
Why? You're being stingy!

21:59.790 --> 22:02.570
I know you made a ton of them!

22:08.090 --> 22:09.870
Should I drink some beer?

22:09.870 --> 22:11.680
I mean, it's the weekend!

22:12.390 --> 22:15.350
Body Composition Scale

22:13.110 --> 22:15.350
I'm done eating...

22:15.350 --> 22:17.700
No! Don't come any closer!

22:17.700 --> 22:20.580
Put that dangerous weapon down!

22:21.110 --> 22:24.110
No! You cruel cat!

22:26.110 --> 22:27.960
No! Lemme go!

22:26.110 --> 22:29.610
Step 0

22:27.610 --> 22:29.610
Step 1

22:27.610 --> 22:29.610
Measure weight with owner.

22:27.960 --> 22:29.610
Let me go!

22:31.060 --> 22:32.610
Scary! Scary! Scary!

22:32.610 --> 22:34.660
Scales are so scary!

22:34.660 --> 22:36.160
Step 1

22:36.160 --> 22:38.290
Step 2

22:36.160 --> 22:38.290
Put owner down and measure again.

22:40.830 --> 22:46.090
Step 1

22:41.330 --> 22:46.090
minus

22:41.880 --> 22:46.090
Step 2

22:42.840 --> 22:46.090
Owner's weight.

22:47.340 --> 22:48.340
Huh?!

22:48.340 --> 22:49.260
Did it go up?!

22:49.260 --> 22:50.230
No!

22:50.230 --> 22:53.100
Our health screening is coming up!

22:54.310 --> 22:59.780
<i>Starting with that night's dinner, 
Yukichi prepared a new diet menu.</i>

23:06.980 --> 23:27.760
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:08.110 --> 23:10.600
I am a masterful cat.

23:10.600 --> 23:12.870
A masterful cat knows.

23:13.460 --> 23:18.900
The calcium necessary for health 
and growth is hard to absorb.

23:18.900 --> 23:23.460
So adding foods with vitamin D 
